        <mxCell id="aim-callback" value="&lt;b&gt;AimRunCallback&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;From Training loop&lt;br&gt;Attach run metadata&lt;br&gt;Track logs" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=14;" parent="1" vertex="1">
